WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.767
Welcome to Module 8 of the
Non-Person Identity learning path:

2
00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:08.525
convert Kerberos accounts to group and
delegated managed service accounts.

3
00:00:08.525 --> 00:00:11.557
This module is the
on-premises part of Gate 5,

4
00:00:11.557 --> 00:00:15.262
Conversion, with Chapter 6
of the developer workbook.

5
00:00:15.262 --> 00:00:19.706
You'll give every Kerberos
account a reviewed disposition,

6
00:00:19.706 --> 00:00:24.330
plan its move to a G M S A or, on a
Windows Server 2025 domain, a D M S A,

7
00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:29.590
list what stays on the Kerberos island
with an S P N owner and an end date,

8
00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:34.487
and reconcile every managed account
with the program's end state.

9
00:00:34.487 --> 00:00:38.387
Then you'll see the write path run
a plan only by its approved hash.

10
00:00:38.387 --> 00:00:43.250
The domain is fictional, and the
apply changes only a fake, in memory.
